          "media_absence_reason": "text_first_pilot",
          "media_role": "none",
          "narration": {
            "fact_ids": [
              "sec07-F07"
            ],
            "text": "Here is a quick check: after buckling, how do you confirm your belt fit is correct. You wear a snug shoulder strap across shoulder and chest with the lap low across the hips, never under the arm or behind the back. Say those landmarks in order during your check. If the lap rides high or the shoulder slips off, refit before moving. Correct placement is the difference between restraint and injury."
          },
          "slide_id": "sec07-u03-s06",
          "title": {
            "fact_ids": [
              "sec07-F07"
            ],
            "text": "Confirm Fit Before Moving"
          }
        },
        {
          "estimated_narration_seconds": 42,
          "kind": "close",
          "lines": [
            {
              "fact_ids": [
                "sec07-F06"
              ],
              "text": "Everyone restrained keeps control possible."
            },
            {
              "fact_ids": [
                "sec07-R05"
